=== Text #5 ===
> As a parent or[ careg]iver, have you ever wished that you could get to the core reasons why your child is challenged with time, organization,[ or emotional] control?
Do you KNOW your child is bright and capable, and yet[ dis]organized[ notebooks], lost assignments, and[ anxiety] surrounding tests[ get in the] way[ of success]?
